<title>BRAZIL: Brazil judge to rule on CVRD injunction.</title>
<headline>Brazil judge to rule on CVRD injunction.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A judge on Brazil's highest court is expected to rule Thursday on an injunction against the privatization of Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD), a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said Supreme Federal Tribunal (STF) Judge Carlos Velloso was considering an appeal against the sale filed by two lawyers from Minas Gerais state, who are contesting CVRD's bid specifications.</p>
<p>No time was set for the judge's ruling, which would have to be considered later by the full court, though the ruling would take effect immediately.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
